' ============================================================================
' System sequence and deployment diagrams
' Disaster Information Analysis System
'
' The backend is a modular monolith: all backend modules execute in one
' FastAPI process. Each @startuml/@enduml block is a separate diagram.
' ============================================================================

@startuml SystemSequence
 title End-to-End System Sequence Diagram
 autonumber
 hide footbox
 skinparam shadowing false
 skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

 actor "CSV Producer" as DataSimulator
 actor "Pipeline Client" as PipelineClient
 actor "Human Reviewer" as Reviewer

 box "Presentation Layer" #E8F1FF
   participant "React Frontend" as Frontend
   participant "API Client" as APIClient
 end box

 box "Orchestration Layer" #FFF2CC
   participant "FastAPI Application" as FastAPIApp
   participant "Ingestion Router" as IngestionRouter
   participant "Processing Router" as ProcessingRouter
   participant "Situation Router" as SituationRouter
 end box

 box "Input Processing Module" #E2F0D9
   participant "Queue Manager" as QueueManager
   participant "Preprocessor" as Preprocessor
   participant "Language Detector" as LanguageDetector
 end box

 box "Analysis Module" #FCE4D6
   participant "Analysis Engine" as AnalysisEngine
   participant "Analysis Models" as AnalysisModels
 end box

 box "Clustering Module" #E4DFEC
   participant "Cluster Manager" as ClusterManager
 end box

 box "Situation Module" #DDEBF7
   participant "Situation Manager" as SituationManager
   participant "Summarizer" as Summarizer
 end box

 box "Evidence Module" #F4CCCC
   participant "Evidence Manager" as EvidenceManager
 end box

 database "MongoDB" as MongoDB

 == Ingestion ==
 DataSimulator -> FastAPIApp : POST /ingestion/ingest
 activate FastAPIApp
 FastAPIApp -> IngestionRouter : route raw event
 activate IngestionRouter
 IngestionRouter -> QueueManager : enqueue(queue item)
 QueueManager --> IngestionRouter : enqueue response
 IngestionRouter --> FastAPIApp : ingestion response
 deactivate IngestionRouter
 FastAPIApp --> DataSimulator : HTTP 200 / ingestion result
 deactivate FastAPIApp

 == Processing and analysis ==
 PipelineClient -> FastAPIApp : request pipeline processing
 activate FastAPIApp
 FastAPIApp -> ProcessingRouter : route preprocessing request
 activate ProcessingRouter
 ProcessingRouter -> QueueManager : dequeue()
 QueueManager --> ProcessingRouter : queued event
 ProcessingRouter -> Preprocessor : clean and validate text
 Preprocessor -> LanguageDetector : detect language and script
 LanguageDetector --> Preprocessor : language information
 Preprocessor --> ProcessingRouter : preprocessing result
 ProcessingRouter -> AnalysisEngine : analyze processed post
 activate AnalysisEngine
 AnalysisEngine -> AnalysisModels : classify and score text
 AnalysisModels --> AnalysisEngine : analysis outputs
 AnalysisEngine --> ProcessingRouter : combined analysis result
 deactivate AnalysisEngine
 ProcessingRouter --> FastAPIApp : analysis response
 deactivate ProcessingRouter
 FastAPIApp --> PipelineClient : processed analysis result
 deactivate FastAPIApp

 == Clustering, situation, and evidence ==
 PipelineClient -> FastAPIApp : submit analysis result
 activate FastAPIApp
 FastAPIApp -> ClusterManager : assign result to cluster
 activate ClusterManager
 ClusterManager --> FastAPIApp : cluster assignment
 deactivate ClusterManager

 FastAPIApp -> SituationManager : create significant situation
 activate SituationManager
 SituationManager -> Summarizer : generate summary
 Summarizer --> SituationManager : situation summary
 SituationManager -> MongoDB : store situation
 MongoDB --> SituationManager : stored situation ID
 SituationManager --> FastAPIApp : situation created
 deactivate SituationManager

 FastAPIApp -> EvidenceManager : extract supporting evidence
 activate EvidenceManager
 EvidenceManager -> MongoDB : store protected evidence
 MongoDB --> EvidenceManager : stored evidence IDs
 EvidenceManager --> FastAPIApp : evidence response
 deactivate EvidenceManager
 FastAPIApp --> PipelineClient : situation and evidence result
 deactivate FastAPIApp

 == Human review and dashboard ==
 Reviewer -> Frontend : open review or dashboard page
 Frontend -> APIClient : request situations or analytics
 APIClient -> FastAPIApp : HTTP request
 activate FastAPIApp
 FastAPIApp -> SituationRouter : route situation request
 activate SituationRouter
 SituationRouter -> MongoDB : query or update situations
 MongoDB --> SituationRouter : situation data
 SituationRouter --> FastAPIApp : JSON response
 deactivate SituationRouter
 FastAPIApp --> APIClient : HTTP JSON response
 deactivate FastAPIApp
 APIClient --> Frontend : parsed response
 Frontend --> Reviewer : display results

 alt Reviewer approves a situation
   Reviewer -> Frontend : approve situation
   Frontend -> APIClient : POST decision(approve)
   APIClient -> FastAPIApp : POST /situations/{id}/decision
   FastAPIApp -> SituationRouter : record approval
   SituationRouter -> MongoDB : update status to confirmed
   MongoDB --> SituationRouter : update result
   SituationRouter --> APIClient : updated situation
   APIClient --> Frontend : refresh review list
 else Reviewer rejects a situation
   Reviewer -> Frontend : reject situation
   Frontend -> APIClient : POST decision(reject)
   APIClient -> FastAPIApp : POST /situations/{id}/decision
   FastAPIApp -> SituationRouter : record rejection
   SituationRouter -> MongoDB : update status to rejected
   MongoDB --> SituationRouter : update result
   SituationRouter --> APIClient : updated situation
   APIClient --> Frontend : refresh review list
 end

 note over FastAPIApp
 All backend modules run inside one FastAPI process.
 The arrows between backend modules represent function or
 module calls, not separate network connections.
 end note
@enduml


@startuml SystemDeployment
 title System Packaging and Deployment Diagram
 left to right direction
 skinparam shadowing false
 skinparam componentStyle rectangle

 actor "System User" as User
 cloud "Input Data Source" as DataSource

 node "Client Machine" as ClientMachine {
   node "Web Browser" as Browser {
     artifact "React/Vite Frontend" as FrontendArtifact
     component "Presentation Layer" as Presentation
   }
 }

 node "Application Host" as ApplicationHost {
   node "Vite Development Server" as ViteServer {
     artifact "frontend/dist or Vite app" as ViteArtifact
   }

   node "Python Runtime" as PythonRuntime {
     artifact "app/main.py" as MainArtifact
     component "FastAPI Application" as FastAPIApp

     package "Orchestration Layer" {
       component "Ingestion Router" as IngestionRouter
       component "Processing Router" as ProcessingRouter
       component "Clustering Router" as ClusteringRouter
       component "Situation Router" as SituationRouter
       component "Evidence Router" as EvidenceRouter
       component "Queue Router" as QueueRouter
       component "Summarization Router" as SummarizationRouter
     }

     package "Input Processing Module" {
       component "Queue Manager" as QueueManager
       component "Preprocessor" as Preprocessor
       component "Language Detector" as LanguageDetector
     }

     package "Analysis Module" {
       component "Analysis Engine" as AnalysisEngine
       component "Transformers and PyTorch Models" as AnalysisModels
     }

     package "Clustering Module" {
       component "Cluster Manager" as ClusterManager
       component "Embedding Generator" as EmbeddingGenerator
     }

     package "Situation Module" {
       component "Situation Manager" as SituationManager
       component "Summarizer" as Summarizer
     }

     package "Evidence Module" {
       component "Evidence Manager" as EvidenceManager
       component "Privacy Manager" as PrivacyManager
       component "Evidence Ranker" as EvidenceRanker
     }

     package "Persistent Module" {
       component "Database Client" as DatabaseClient
     }
   }
 }

 node "External Tools Host" as ToolsHost {
   artifact "CSV Dataset" as CSVData
   component "CSV Producer" as CSVProducer
 }

 database "MongoDB Server" as MongoDB {
   artifact "situations collection" as SituationsCollection
   artifact "evidence collection" as EvidenceCollection
 }

 User --> Browser : uses
 Browser --> ViteServer : loads frontend over HTTP
 Presentation --> FastAPIApp : REST/JSON over HTTP

 CSVProducer --> CSVData : reads
 CSVProducer --> IngestionRouter : POST /ingestion/ingest

 MainArtifact ..> FastAPIApp : starts
 FastAPIApp *-- IngestionRouter
 FastAPIApp *-- ProcessingRouter
 FastAPIApp *-- ClusteringRouter
 FastAPIApp *-- SituationRouter
 FastAPIApp *-- EvidenceRouter
 FastAPIApp *-- QueueRouter
 FastAPIApp *-- SummarizationRouter

 IngestionRouter --> QueueManager : function call
 QueueManager --> Preprocessor : queued event
 Preprocessor --> LanguageDetector : function call
 ProcessingRouter --> AnalysisEngine : function call
 AnalysisEngine --> AnalysisModels : in-process inference
 AnalysisEngine --> ClusterManager : analysis result
 ClusteringRouter --> ClusterManager : function call
 ClusterManager --> EmbeddingGenerator : embedding request
 ClusterManager --> SituationManager : significant cluster
 SituationManager --> Summarizer : summary request
 SituationManager --> EvidenceManager : evidence request
 EvidenceManager --> EvidenceRanker : select posts
 EvidenceManager --> PrivacyManager : mask data

 SituationRouter --> DatabaseClient : async database call
 EvidenceManager --> DatabaseClient : async database call
 DatabaseClient --> MongoDB : Motor driver / MongoDB protocol
 MongoDB o-- SituationsCollection
 MongoDB o-- EvidenceCollection

 note right of PythonRuntime
 One Python process contains the FastAPI application,
 routers, processing modules, ML inference, clustering,
 situation management, evidence management, and database client.
 end note

 note right of MongoDB
 Persistent storage is external to the FastAPI process.
 The queue and active clusters are currently in-memory.
 end note

 note bottom of ToolsHost
 CSV Producer is an external development and testing tool.
 It is not part of the deployed FastAPI application.
 end note
@enduml
